WEBVTT

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:15.600
One hundred years have passed
since the Battle of Galluah Plains,

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.900
where King Kyle defeated
the Dark Lord Angmund.

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:22.480
The Demons rise again,
threatening the world

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:25.980
and spreading fear and unrest to all.

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:31.310
Kasel and his friends are intercepted
by Malduk, Maria, and the Dark Lord.

00:00:31.310 --> 00:00:33.770
Pavel is knocked out by the Dark Lord's attack,

00:00:33.770 --> 00:00:37.650
and he and the others
are dropped off of a cliff.

00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:40.270
In this moment of extreme danger,
they are saved by Maria.

00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:43.650
She begins telling the truth to Kasel.

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:49.100
That's too bad. Lua won't save you.

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:55.560
Maria... What happened back then?

00:01:01.230 --> 00:01:06.100
<i>When the red-stained night comes</i>

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.310
<i>I paint you on the sky</i>

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:21.720
"KING's RAID:
Successors of the Will"

00:01:22.350 --> 00:01:26.190
<i>The hidden truth</i>

00:01:26.190 --> 00:01:30.730
<i>The sudden suffocation</i>

00:01:32.230 --> 00:01:35.980
<i>You are so distant, fading</i>

00:01:35.980 --> 00:01:40.650
<i>Do you feel it too?</i>

00:01:40.650 --> 00:01:42.980
<i>Crossing blades</i>

00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:45.810
<i>Cannot touch</i>

00:01:45.810 --> 00:01:50.440
<i>The sadness that lies beyond</i>

00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:52.940
<i>I just want to see you</i>

00:01:52.940 --> 00:01:56.940
<i>I search for you</i>

00:01:56.940 --> 00:02:00.350
<i>Now, Eclipse</i>

00:02:00.350 --> 00:02:05.230
<i>I always want to be by your side</i>

00:02:05.230 --> 00:02:07.900
<i>I send a wish to the sky</i>

00:02:07.900 --> 00:02:10.100
<i>I believe in destiny</i>

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:12.520
<i>When the sun and moon meet</i>

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:14.980
<i>At that moment</i>

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:18.190
<i>I run to you</i>

00:02:18.190 --> 00:02:22.060
<i>With all my heart</i>

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:35.920
<i></i>Maria's Rain

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:35.920
<i></i>of Tears

00:02:43.730 --> 00:02:46.270
I was a priestess of the teachings of Lua,

00:02:46.270 --> 00:02:49.560
and also served as aided to Kyle,
my childhood friend.

00:03:02.310 --> 00:03:04.350
You've gotten better, Kyle.

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:06.440
Ouch...

00:03:06.440 --> 00:03:07.850
Kyle, show me!

00:03:12.230 --> 00:03:14.060
Yeah, I'm fine now.

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:17.600
Aren't you training a bit too hard?
You need to take care of yourself.

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:21.770
It's nothing. I need to train myself more,
both physically and mentally.

00:03:21.770 --> 00:03:24.100
Otherwise, I don't deserve the throne.

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:25.650
But...

00:03:25.650 --> 00:03:29.310
I'll be fine. If I do get in trouble,
Maria will take care of me.

00:03:29.310 --> 00:03:30.730
Kyle.

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:33.230
That's not a healthy attitude.

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:36.310
You need to learn the proper techniques
to avoid getting hurt.

00:03:36.310 --> 00:03:37.520
Yes.

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:42.060
Fine, fine. I'm sorry. I can't have
the both of you be mad at me.

00:03:42.060 --> 00:03:44.940
Kyle was always full of cuts and bruises.

00:03:44.940 --> 00:03:50.400
But back then, I believed that my purpose
in life was to heal and protect him.

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:52.730
Kyle also visited the town often.

00:03:52.730 --> 00:03:57.980
That day, he was out in town,
incognito, as usual.

00:03:57.980 --> 00:04:01.730
Kyle, you need to spend less time outside.

00:04:01.730 --> 00:04:07.230
You have the right of succession.
If something were to happen to you...

00:04:07.230 --> 00:04:11.310
Don't worry so much. It'd be great
if you could leave me alone for a change.

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:13.060
I can't do that.

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:16.600
I'll follow you to the end of the world
if that's where you're going.

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:21.770
The end of the world huh? That's reassuring.

00:04:21.770 --> 00:04:24.940
Support Kyle, by his side, forever...

00:04:24.940 --> 00:04:28.020
I never once doubted that.

00:04:28.850 --> 00:04:32.190
I'm getting hungry.

00:04:32.190 --> 00:04:35.770
I know, let's pay a visit to that
delicious bakery I found the other day.

00:04:39.100 --> 00:04:40.690
Hey, baker, are you there?

00:04:40.690 --> 00:04:43.690
Oh... Apologies, we're sold out right now.

00:04:43.690 --> 00:04:46.060
What about that one there?

00:04:46.060 --> 00:04:48.150
I'll take that one. How much?

00:04:48.150 --> 00:04:51.850
I'm so sorry... This one is reserved.

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:53.940
I'll negotiate with the person
who reserved it, then.

00:04:53.940 --> 00:04:55.730
Well, but...

00:04:55.730 --> 00:04:57.850
That's not the issue.

00:04:58.850 --> 00:05:03.900
That bread is reserved for someone special.

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:05.480
Someone special?

00:05:05.480 --> 00:05:07.850
If you can wait a short while, you'll see.

00:05:07.850 --> 00:05:09.400
Who are you?

00:05:09.400 --> 00:05:12.230
I am a person that frequents this bakery.

00:05:12.230 --> 00:05:17.400
Uh, I can bake a new batch,
if you can give me a bit more time...

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:20.060
Fine. Let's wait, like you said.

00:05:20.060 --> 00:05:22.940
When you said waiting would answer
my question, it made me want to wait.

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:24.100
What?

00:05:25.520 --> 00:05:26.690
Here he comes.

00:05:28.650 --> 00:05:29.900
One bread, please!

00:05:29.900 --> 00:05:31.020
Gotcha.

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:35.850
Thank you!

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:40.400
That boy carries bricks every day.

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:41.980
Carries bricks?

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:48.100
My family contracted
the workshop his parents work in.

00:05:48.100 --> 00:05:54.230
But his parents were injured,
so he is working in their place.

00:05:54.230 --> 00:05:58.230
He goes to work with bread in hand.

00:05:58.230 --> 00:06:02.650
He learned the joy of working
and helping his parents.

00:06:02.650 --> 00:06:06.650
I understand what you're saying.
He's a good kid.

00:06:06.650 --> 00:06:09.810
I know, I'll take care of that kid.

00:06:09.810 --> 00:06:13.150
We need to make a world where
those who work hard are rewarded.

00:06:13.150 --> 00:06:15.940
Even if you were able to save that one child,

00:06:15.940 --> 00:06:19.150
there are countless more in a similar situation.

00:06:19.150 --> 00:06:21.310
Can you save them all?

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:27.560
Hmm... Maybe not right away,
but I hope to be able to, some day.

00:06:27.560 --> 00:06:29.400
No, I will solve this, for sure!

00:06:29.400 --> 00:06:34.650
I see. Well, I hope you are able
to deliver, Prince Kyle.

00:06:34.650 --> 00:06:36.850
Yes, you can count on me!

00:06:36.850 --> 00:06:39.560
Wait, you knew?

00:06:39.560 --> 00:06:41.480
Yes.

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:45.150
Nice to meet you, Prince Kyle.
My name is Arlette.

00:06:45.150 --> 00:06:48.060
I thought nobody noticed...

00:06:48.060 --> 00:06:50.480
You couldn't be more obvious.

00:06:50.480 --> 00:06:54.520
Still, Arlette, you're quite...

00:06:54.520 --> 00:06:58.690
Brave, I must say, or confident.

00:06:58.690 --> 00:07:01.230
I almost want you to join the knights.

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:03.770
That doesn't sound like a compliment.

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:07.850
Really? It's the highest form of praise
from my point of view.

00:07:07.850 --> 00:07:11.060
Then I suppose I ought to thank you.

00:07:11.060 --> 00:07:13.730
What do you mean "suppose"?

00:07:20.560 --> 00:07:24.400
That is how Kyle and Arlette met.

00:07:24.400 --> 00:07:28.730
It didn't take long for them to fall in love.

00:07:28.730 --> 00:07:36.190
But the king and many of the nobles
didn't like their relationship deepening.

00:07:36.190 --> 00:07:39.980
Then, one day, Arlette disappeared.

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:51.980
Before Kyle had a chance to feel sad,
Demons began appearing all over.

00:07:51.980 --> 00:07:57.850
Kyle led the knights
to actively hunt them down.

00:07:57.850 --> 00:08:01.400
Soon after, he became king.

00:08:02.980 --> 00:08:07.440
The Demonic invasion seems endless.
The situation is still dire.

00:08:07.440 --> 00:08:13.600
But now that I'm king, I will take down
every last one of these Demons!

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:17.270
As king, I will protect my people!

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:25.650
And thus, we headed out
on a journey to hunt Demons.

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:31.770
We met powerful allies along the way.

00:08:31.770 --> 00:08:36.560
We bonded together,
vowing to bring back peace.

00:08:37.520 --> 00:08:40.690
All throughout the trip,
I prayed to the goddess Lua,

00:08:40.690 --> 00:08:43.810
for the future of the kingdom and Kyle's safety.

00:08:45.520 --> 00:08:51.150
But despite my prayers, the Demons
became more active and powerful each day.

00:08:53.940 --> 00:08:56.980
Everyone is extremely tired.

00:08:56.980 --> 00:09:01.850
It's too dangerous to keep
fighting like this. We need to rest.

00:09:02.650 --> 00:09:04.350
You're right...

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:09.480
Does anyone need water?

00:09:12.230 --> 00:09:13.600
Arlette!

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:16.020
Kyle!

00:09:16.020 --> 00:09:18.980
I've been searching for you for so long...

00:09:20.230 --> 00:09:21.400
Why?

00:09:21.400 --> 00:09:23.560
Why did you leave me?

00:09:24.770 --> 00:09:29.440
You were going to become king.
I would have gotten in the way of that.

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:31.270
That's impossible!

00:09:31.270 --> 00:09:34.440
You need to put your kingdom first.

00:09:34.440 --> 00:09:38.520
If I can't protect the woman I love,
how can I protect a whole kingdom?

00:09:39.940 --> 00:09:41.400
Kyle...

00:09:45.850 --> 00:09:49.600
It's definitely a boy. Let's name him Kasel!

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:56.270
I want to protect the world
for this new child to enter into it.

00:09:56.270 --> 00:10:01.520
Then, a new hope was brought to Kyle,
adding to his vision of a bright future.

00:10:12.480 --> 00:10:14.730
I received an oracle from the goddess Lua.

00:10:15.940 --> 00:10:17.770
From Lua...?

00:10:17.770 --> 00:10:20.440
When the red ring encircles the moon,

00:10:20.440 --> 00:10:24.350
the Dark Lord will appear
and threaten the world...

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:29.060
But with the Holy Sword Aea,
we can destroy the Dark Lord.

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:32.690
Please, I need everyone's help.

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:34.810
We cannot lose.

00:10:34.810 --> 00:10:38.440
Let's all save the world together!

00:10:38.440 --> 00:10:43.480
With the Holy Sword in his hands,
Kyle was shining with confidence.

00:10:43.480 --> 00:10:48.400
I had no reason to doubt
that Lua would protect Kyle--

00:10:48.400 --> 00:10:51.770
that he would be okay.

00:10:51.770 --> 00:10:56.350
Lua, I thank you from
the bottom of my heart...

00:10:56.350 --> 00:11:01.850
I even thought that Lua heard my prayers.

00:11:01.850 --> 00:11:04.560
Kyle promised Arlette
that he would come back for her

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:07.400
as soon as he defeated the Dark Lord.

00:11:07.400 --> 00:11:09.690
Wait for me, Kasel!

00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:18.980
They bid farewell with a smile.

00:11:18.980 --> 00:11:23.650
They probably had no idea that
they would never see each other again.

00:11:23.650 --> 00:11:27.650
I remember how King Kyle was back then.

00:11:27.650 --> 00:11:31.440
He spoke to the unborn child
about so many things.

00:11:31.440 --> 00:11:33.940
He seemed very happy.

00:11:36.690 --> 00:11:40.520
Soon after, Illya sent a letter.

00:11:42.600 --> 00:11:46.440
Maria, development of
my magical device is complete.

00:11:46.440 --> 00:11:50.020
This should be able to protect Kyle.

00:11:55.980 --> 00:12:01.560
The Dark Lord will appear through
the dimensional rift I created.

00:12:01.560 --> 00:12:06.100
The Dark Lord's name, as given by Lea,
the Goddess of Darkness, is "Angmund."

00:12:12.480 --> 00:12:14.980
Death to all who stand in our way!

00:12:14.980 --> 00:12:16.810
Kyle, go on without us!

00:12:16.810 --> 00:12:18.520
We will handle this!

00:12:18.520 --> 00:12:20.230
Got it! I'm counting on you!

00:12:54.060 --> 00:12:55.600
Run, all of you!

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:19.600
Hurry...

00:14:31.560 --> 00:14:32.140
Let's go!

00:14:32.140 --> 00:14:33.730
Yes!

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:39.350
What is this place?

00:15:03.940 --> 00:15:06.480
A fierce battle ensued.

00:15:12.650 --> 00:15:16.190
And finally, it seemed like Kyle
delivered the killing blow.

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:24.270
Kyle?!

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:27.520
Lua, please save Kyle! Please!

00:15:28.770 --> 00:15:33.060
At that point, for some reason,
the Holy Sword lost its power.

00:15:46.650 --> 00:15:49.100
My child, please...

00:15:49.100 --> 00:15:50.770
Kyle!

00:15:53.520 --> 00:15:56.480
Kyle disappeared beyond the dimensional rift,

00:15:56.480 --> 00:15:59.440
and only the Holy Sword remained.

00:16:00.650 --> 00:16:06.020
Why... Why did you take
the power away from the Holy Sword?

00:16:06.020 --> 00:16:08.690
Lua, why?!

00:16:10.190 --> 00:16:11.600
Illya!

00:16:13.520 --> 00:16:17.520
Illya might know how to save Kyle.

00:16:17.520 --> 00:16:21.900
I rushed to find Illya,
grasping on to that slim hope.

00:16:26.690 --> 00:16:30.980
She saved us... But the Demons...

00:16:32.020 --> 00:16:34.690
All hope was lost.

00:16:51.060 --> 00:16:54.980
Lua! Why?! You are the Goddess of Light.

00:16:54.980 --> 00:16:58.100
You're supposed to give us hope!

00:16:58.100 --> 00:17:01.400
Why did you betray those
who believe in you?!

00:17:01.400 --> 00:17:02.940
Lua!

00:17:04.810 --> 00:17:09.940
Then, I heard the voice of Lea,
the Goddess of Darkness, in my head.

00:17:15.650 --> 00:17:19.810
Lea said, if I wanted to save Kyle
from the world of darkness,

00:17:19.810 --> 00:17:22.020
I, too, must fall into darkness.

00:17:22.020 --> 00:17:23.850
I must curse Lua.

00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:26.650
Lua!

00:17:26.650 --> 00:17:30.480
I will never forgive you!

00:17:37.940 --> 00:17:43.020
I became a Demon, and began
to search for a way to rescue Kyle.

00:17:43.020 --> 00:17:46.730
But there was no such way.

00:17:46.730 --> 00:17:52.650
That's why I thought,
if the dimensional rift could be opened again,

00:17:52.650 --> 00:17:55.980
I can enter the world of darkness,
and I can go look for Kyle there.

00:17:55.980 --> 00:17:58.810
To save King Kyle.

00:17:58.810 --> 00:17:59.940
Yes.

00:17:59.940 --> 00:18:01.150
Maria...

00:18:01.150 --> 00:18:05.400
We share your desire to save King Kyle.

00:18:05.400 --> 00:18:10.350
Then perhaps we can fight
the Dark Lord together, too.

00:18:10.350 --> 00:18:13.270
Lea would not allow that.

00:18:13.270 --> 00:18:16.100
I wouldn't be able to forgive myself either.

00:18:16.100 --> 00:18:17.400
Besides...

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:19.980
Things aren't that simple.

00:18:21.520 --> 00:18:24.940
The dimensional rift opened
for the first time in 100 years.

00:18:24.940 --> 00:18:29.150
And out came Kyle,
who I had been waiting for...

00:18:29.150 --> 00:18:30.400
King Kyle?!

00:18:30.400 --> 00:18:32.560
He is alive?!

00:18:32.560 --> 00:18:35.940
Kyle did appear before me.

00:18:35.940 --> 00:18:38.270
As the Dark Lord Angmund.

00:18:39.480 --> 00:18:43.900
Wait... So the person we fought was...

00:18:43.900 --> 00:18:46.310
That is Kyle, who is now the Dark Lord.

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:53.310
Kyle has been infested by dark forces
and became the Dark Lord.

00:18:53.310 --> 00:18:57.350
So Kasel has to fight his real father?

00:18:58.520 --> 00:18:59.560
But...

00:19:01.230 --> 00:19:04.900
If King Kyle is just under
the influence of dark powers,

00:19:04.900 --> 00:19:07.560
maybe there's a way to save him.

00:19:07.560 --> 00:19:12.060
Don't have hope.
It tends to change into despair.

00:19:12.060 --> 00:19:14.520
Lua will not save you.

00:19:14.520 --> 00:19:17.900
I don't know about the goddess Lua...

00:19:17.900 --> 00:19:19.690
But hope...

00:19:19.690 --> 00:19:22.980
Hope, I think, is something
you have to hold on to!

00:19:22.980 --> 00:19:28.850
I will get the Holy Sword,
and I will rescue King Kyle!

00:19:30.020 --> 00:19:32.480
Yes. Yes, Kasel.

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:33.770
Of course.

00:19:33.770 --> 00:19:35.020
Yeah.

00:19:36.810 --> 00:19:39.350
Pavel is awake!

00:19:39.350 --> 00:19:40.810
Let's go!

00:19:55.150 --> 00:19:56.440
Miss Maria!

00:19:57.230 --> 00:20:01.350
You loved King Kyle, didn't you?

00:20:01.350 --> 00:20:08.190
Kasel. When I see him, it reminds me
of Kyle back then, and brings back feelings.

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:13.850
I thought I got rid of
these feelings long ago, but...

00:20:18.350 --> 00:20:22.980
Why did the goddess Lua
take away the Holy Sword's power?

00:20:22.980 --> 00:20:26.150
I'm sure there was some reason.

00:20:26.150 --> 00:20:30.520
No matter what the reason was,
there's no doubt that she took the power away.

00:20:30.520 --> 00:20:34.770
What will you do if Lua betrays you, too?

00:20:34.770 --> 00:20:38.770
I will still live by Kasel's side!

00:20:38.770 --> 00:20:40.100
I see.

00:20:44.900 --> 00:20:48.350
Master Pavel. Are you all right?

00:20:48.350 --> 00:20:51.900
In my current state, I will be a burden.

00:20:51.900 --> 00:20:53.690
There's no other choice.

00:20:53.690 --> 00:20:56.440
I will unlock the final seal now.

00:21:27.940 --> 00:21:33.770
Kasel. Get the Holy Sword,
before the Dark Lord--before Malduk!

00:21:33.770 --> 00:21:35.230
Yes!

00:21:44.400 --> 00:21:46.150
This power...

00:21:53.810 --> 00:21:58.190
Selene, you must go with Kasel.

00:21:58.190 --> 00:22:00.940
I will protect the Forest of Elidora.

00:22:08.400 --> 00:22:14.940
Kasel. Please shatter the darkness
and bring light to the future of this world.

00:22:16.560 --> 00:22:19.310
<i>This one wish</i>

00:22:19.310 --> 00:22:22.020
<i>Connects you and me</i>

00:22:22.020 --> 00:22:24.810
<i>I wait so impatiently for tomorrow</i>

00:22:24.810 --> 00:22:28.850
<i>Because I know you now</i>

00:22:40.270 --> 00:22:45.400
<i>A comfortable breeze passes over</i>

00:22:45.400 --> 00:22:51.310
<i>A memory in a precious place</i>

00:22:51.310 --> 00:22:55.940
<i>From the day I decided to walk with you</i>

00:22:55.940 --> 00:23:02.600
<i>The promise that I hid in my heart</i>

00:23:02.600 --> 00:23:08.060
<i>I want to feel that moment, just once</i>

00:23:08.060 --> 00:23:10.350
<i>If I stretch my arm out</i>

00:23:10.350 --> 00:23:13.730
<i>I should be able to reach</i>
<i>the tomorrow in my dream</i>

00:23:13.730 --> 00:23:16.400
<i>This one wish</i>

00:23:16.400 --> 00:23:19.270
<i>I gently engrave in my heart</i>

00:23:19.270 --> 00:23:22.020
<i>The chain that connects the heart</i>

00:23:22.020 --> 00:23:24.810
<i>Cannot ever be broken</i>

00:23:24.810 --> 00:23:27.600
<i>The future which we should head to</i>

00:23:27.600 --> 00:23:30.400
<i>Beckons us to come closer</i>

00:23:30.400 --> 00:23:33.230
<i>I wait so impatiently for tomorrow</i>

00:23:33.230 --> 00:23:36.190
<i>Because I know you now</i>

00:23:46.850 --> 00:23:50.020
Defeat the Dark Lord Angmund.

00:23:50.020 --> 00:23:53.060
That is the duty of the heir to the Holy Sword.

00:23:53.060 --> 00:23:56.980
But if he defeats the Dark Lord, Kasel will...

00:23:56.980 --> 00:24:00.730
We band together,
to try to shake away the worry.

00:23:59.040 --> 00:24:00.910
<i></i>Those Who

00:23:59.040 --> 00:24:00.910
<i></i>Stand Firm
